Lugupeetud domeeni <%= @domain.name %> registreerija/halduskontakt

Eesti Interneti Sihtasutusele (EIS) on Rahvastikuregistri andmetel saanud teatavaks, et domeeni <%= @domain.name %> halduskontakt on surnud.

Vastavalt .ee domeenireeglitele (https://www.internet.ee/domeenid/ee-domeenireeglid) peab juriidilisele isikule kuuluval domeenil olema kehtiv halduskontakt. Selle puudumise tõttu algatas EIS domeeni osas kustutusmenetluse tähtajaga <%= @domain.force_delete_last_day %>. Kehtiva halduskontakti uuendamiseni on blokeeritud domeeni pikendamise ja registripidaja vahetuse toimingud.

Uue halduskontakti lisamiseks pöörduge palun oma registripidaja <%= @registrar.name %> poole.

Domeen on internetis kättesaadav kuni <%= @domain.force_delete_outzone_date %>. Juhul, kui domeeni halduskontakti pole õigeaegselt uuendatud, suunatakse domeen kustutusmenetluse lõppedes <%= @domain.force_delete_date %> avalikule domeenioksjonile https://auction.internet.ee. Kui domeen ei leia oksjonilt uut omanikku, vabaneb see registreerimiseks kõigile huvilistele "kes ees, see mees" põhimõttel.

Lisaküsimuste korral võtke palun ühendust oma registripidajaga:
<%= render 'mailers/shared/registrar/registrar.et.text', registrar: @registrar %>
<%= render 'mailers/shared/signatures/signature.et.text' %>

--------------------------------------

Dear registrant/administrative contact of <%= @domain.name %> domain,

According to the Estonian Population Register, the Estonian Internet Foundation (EIF) has been informed that the administrative contact of the domain <%= @domain.name %> has passed away.

According to the .ee Domain Regulation (https://www.internet.ee/domains/ee-domain-regulation), a domain owned by a legal entity must have a valid administrative contact. As the domain has no valid administrative contact, EIF has started the deletion process of the domain with a deadline of <%= @domain.force_delete_last_day %>. Until a valid administrative contact is added, the domain cannot be renewed or transferred to another registrar.

To add a new administrative contact, please contact your registrar <%= @registrar.name %>.

The domain will remain available on the Internet until <%= @domain.force_delete_outzone_date %>. If the administrative contact has not been updated in time, the domain will go to a public domain auction https://auction.internet.ee at the end of the deletion process on <%= @domain.force_delete_date %>. If the domain does not find a new owner through the auction, it becomes available for registration to anyone on a first-come, first-served basis.

Should you have additional questions, please contact your registrar:
<%= render 'mailers/shared/registrar/registrar.en.text', registrar: @registrar %>
<%= render 'mailers/shared/signatures/signature.en.text' %>
